Z||000000||Jackalrr||12-25-2000||10:41 PM||||Fieroperformance.com ( <A HREF="http://www.fieroperformance.com" TARGET=_blank>www.fieroperformance.com</A>  ). Is under construction. My hope is to bring even more people to the every growing Fiero community and maybe make some extra cash. I plan on having the usual stuff (gallery, info, links) and selling some custom performance products. Right now plans are in the works to get some side scoops made. If anyone has any input or ideas please let me know. I will be accepting some pictures to put the in gallery, so if you have any nice quality photos of your car please either post them or send them to me at jackalrr@cinci.rr.com , or you can speak with me directly on AOL. My screen name is JackalFU<P>I hope to hear from you,<BR>-Charlie<BR><p>[This message has been edited by Jackalrr (edited 12-26-2000).]||||reg||10
Z||000001||DaRkLoRD||12-26-2000||05:01 PM||||I have a bit of extra cash on hand right now, so I'll be ordering the JC Whitney scoops before I go back to school in January.. Then, as soon as I get those I need to find a good fiberglass place nearby to copy the prototype panels.<P>then you'll have a supply of inexpensive panels to sell.  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/smile.gif"><P>------------------<BR>  <A HREF="mailto:steve@fieroproject.com">steve@fieroproject.com</A>  <BR><A HREF="http://www.fieroproject.com" TARGET=_blank>http://www.fieroproject.com</A>||||reg||14
